[SQL: -- Description: Active traders (unique signers) per aggregator (DEX trades)
-- Filters dex_trades by outer_program (aggregator as entry point)
-- No pricing joins needed

/*
Logic:
- Aggregator programs: Jupiter (7 programs), OKX (2), Titan, Dflow, Byreal Route
- Filters to trades where outer_program is a known aggregator
- Outputs: block_date, aggregator, swaps, active_traders
